======================================================================
CHECK 3: Gorni-Zampieri pairing determinant identity (Prop 6.2.7)
======================================================================
G=(AX)^{*3}, A=[[1,-1],[1,-1]] (A^2=0), N=2 : ['(1)*x0^3 + (-3)*x0^2*x1^1 + (3)*x0^1*x1^2 + (-1)*x1^3', '(1)*x0^3 + (-3)*x0^2*x1^1 + (3)*x0^1*x1^2 + (-1)*x1^3']
  detJ_X(X+G) = (1) (=1 => Keller)
F=T G(T^{-1}X): ['0', '(1)*x0^3']
H (n=1)      : 0
  detJ(x+H) = (1)  (equals detJ_X(X+G) above => Keller preserved)

ALL CHECKS: each shear preserves detJ as a POLYNOMIAL IDENTITY (all x), not on a section.
